\"Chris Lattner at FOSDEM in 2011\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Chris_Lattner_at_FOSDEM_2011_%28colorized%29.jpg/250px-Chris_Lattner_at_FOSDEM_2011_%28colorized%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"333\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Chris_Lattner_at_FOSDEM_2011_%28colorized%29.jpg/500px-Chris_Lattner_at_FOSDEM_2011_%28colorized%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1600\" /></a></span><div class=\"infobox-caption\">Chris Lattner at <a href=\"/wiki/FOSDEM\" title=\"FOSDEM\">FOSDEM</a> in 2011</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Born</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><div style=\"display:inline\" class=\"nickname\">Christopher Arthur Lattner</div><br />1978\n (age&#160;47&#8211;48)<span style=\"display:none\" data-plural=\"1\"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Education</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1126788409\">.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Portland\" title=\"University of Portland\">University of Portland</a> (BS)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Illinois_at_Urbana-Champaign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign\">University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign</a> (MS, PhD)</li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Known&#160;for</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/LLVM\" title=\"LLVM\">LLVM</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Clang\" title=\"Clang\">Clang</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Swift_(programming_language)\" title=\"Swift (programming language)\">Swift language</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Mojo_(programming_language)\" title=\"Mojo (programming language)\">Mojo language</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/MLIR_(software)\" title=\"MLIR (software)\">MLIR</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Spouse</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Tanya Lattner</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Awards</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ACM_SIGPLAN_Programming_Languages_Software_Award\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ACM SIGPLAN Programming Languages Software Award\">ACM SIGPLAN Programming Languages Software Award</a> (2010)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/ACM_Software_System_Award\" title=\"ACM Software System Award\">ACM Software System Award</a> (2012)</li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><b>Scientific career</b></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Fields</th><td class=\"infobox-data category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Compiler\" title=\"Compiler\">Compilers</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Programming_language\" title=\"Programming language\">Programming languages</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Workplaces</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li>Modular AI</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/SiFive\" title=\"SiFive\">SiFive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Google\" title=\"Google\">Google</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tesla,_Inc.\" title=\"Tesla, Inc.\">Tesla, Inc.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Apple_Inc.\" title=\"Apple Inc.\">Apple Inc.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Qualcomm_Inc.\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Qualcomm Inc.\">Qualcomm Inc.</a></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thesis\" title=\"Thesis\">Thesis</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://hdl.handle.net/2142/10994\">Macroscopic Data Structure Analysis and Optimization</a></i>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:97%;\">(2005)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Doctoral_advisor\" title=\"Doctoral advisor\">Doctoral advisor</a></div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vikram_Adve\" title=\"Vikram Adve\">Vikram Adve</a></td></tr><tr style=\"display:none\"><td colspan=\"2\">\n</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Website</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"official-website\"><span class=\"url\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://nondot.org/sabre/\">nondot<wbr />.org<wbr />/sabre<wbr />/</a></span></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-text-top\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2964778#P856\" title=\"Edit this at Wikidata\"><img alt=\"Edit this at Wikidata\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/8a/OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg/20px-OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Christopher Arthur Lattner</b> (born 1978) is an American <a href=\"/wiki/Software_engineer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Software engineer\">software engineer</a> and creator of <a href=\"/wiki/LLVM\" title=\"LLVM\">LLVM</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Clang\" title=\"Clang\">Clang</a> compiler, the <a href=\"/wiki/Swift_(programming_language)\" title=\"Swift (programming language)\">Swift programming language</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/MLIR_(software)\" title=\"MLIR (software)\">MLIR</a> compiler infrastructure.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-mlir&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-mlir-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>After his PhD in computer science, Lattner worked at <a href=\"/wiki/Apple_Inc.\" title=\"Apple Inc.\">Apple</a> for 12 years, eventually leading the Developer Tools team.\nBetween 2017 and 2022, Lattner worked in various positions for <a href=\"/wiki/Tesla,_Inc.\" title=\"Tesla, Inc.\">Tesla</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Google\" title=\"Google\">Google</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Google&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Google-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and <a href=\"/wiki/SiFive\" title=\"SiFive\">SiFive</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> He is currently co-founder and CEO of Modular AI, a company building an <a href=\"/wiki/Artificial_intelligence\" title=\"Artificial intelligence\">artificial intelligence</a> developer platform.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ModularMojo&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ModularMojo-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-mlir-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-mlir_1-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1333433106\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw